-- Where the mod's logic lives.
--
-- Today it runs in Global. With the loader, Global becomes a small frozen
-- shell and the same logic runs in a "brain" object with a fixed GUID. Code
-- that reaches the logic from elsewhere goes through Brain(), so it works in
-- both setups: no brain on the table means Global, as before.

BRAIN_GUID = 'b7a1e0'

function Brain()
  return getObjectFromGUID(BRAIN_GUID) or Global
end
